  "title": "Healthier Chicken Enchiladas",
  "description": "A family favorite, these healthy chicken enchiladas are made with reduced-fat cheese, beans, bell peppers, and whole wheat tortillas. Colorful and flavorful!",
  "authors": [
    "MakeItHealthy"
  ],
